"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e2%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eOthers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e5%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e**Ranking is according to the latest quarter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eData on this page is updated every quarter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThis data represents the global smartphone market share by quarter (from 2023-2026) by top OEMs. Global smartphone shipments by market share and millions of units are provided.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eFor detailed insights on the data, please reach out to us at\u0026nbsp;sales@counterpointresearch.com. If you are a member of the press, please contact us at\u0026nbsp;press@counterpointresearch.com\u0026nbsp;for any media enquiries.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"paywall\"\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\"\u003e\u003cli value=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eUS smartphone shipments grew 6% YoY in Q2 2026, as global memory constraints are pushing shipment volumes higher ahead of further RAM/NAND price increases. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple's shipment share was flat YoY but down 4% points QoQ as volumes decreased after the launch of the 17e during Q1. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung grew its share 3% point YoY and 4% points QoQ. The OEM is heavily shipping A17 5G units to get ahead of memory price increases. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola's shipment share declined by 1% point YoY. Prepaid demand remained weak but the OEM is maintaining double digit shipment share as it competes with Samsung in the low-end market.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"5\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eGoogle's shipment share increased by 1% point YoY  and was flat QoQ. Google's Pixel brand remains aggressive in postpaid, with the OEM growing its shipment units YoY as it is able to gain adequate memory components from its suppliers.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThese smartphone market share numbers are from:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/reports/market-monitor-oem-shipment-by-region-and-countries-q2-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 hover:underline\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Monitor - OEM Shipment by Region and Countries, Q2 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eExcel File | Published Date: August 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThis report is part of a series of market monitor reports which track the mobile handset market: Smartphone and Feature Phone shipments every quarter for more than 140 brands covering more than 97% of the total device shipments in the industry.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/reports/market-monitor-oem-shipment-by-region-and-countries-q2-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 hover:underline\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eRead more\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 hover:underline\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eContact us\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2026 Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"editor-image\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://static.counterpointresearch.com/statics/images/admin/74d8e1f0-a50b-11f1-80d6-3f15a78e7327.png\" alt=\"US Smartphone Shipments Q1 (2025) - Q1 (2026)\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"w-full h-full\" data-full-width=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eUS Smartphone Shipments Market Share (%)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable class=\"border-collapse w-full my-4 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBRANDS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ2 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e57%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e54%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e50%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e67%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e58%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e25%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e27%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e24%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e17%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e26%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e11%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e12%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e12%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e10%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e10%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eGoogle\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e2%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e2%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eOthers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e5%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e5%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e**Ranking is according to the latest quarter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eData on this page is updated every quarter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThis data represents the global smartphone market share by quarter (from 2023-2026) by top OEMs. Global smartphone shipments by market share and millions of units are provided.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cem class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eFor detailed insights on the data, please reach out to us at\u0026nbsp;sales@counterpointresearch.com. If you are a member of the press, please contact us at\u0026nbsp;press@counterpointresearch.com\u0026nbsp;for any media enquiries.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\"\u003e\u003cli value=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eUS smartphone shipments contracted 3% YoY in Q1 2026, mainly due to unfavorable YoY comparisons from the end-of-Q1 2025 tariff-related sell-in surges, combined with weaker low-end shipments this year driven by the global memory shortage, particularly LPDDR4X constraints. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple's shipment share was up by 1% point YoY but down 9% points QoQ due to typical seasonality. iPhone 17 shipments remained strong as Q4 2025 experienced some shortages, helping the YoY share gain. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung grew its share 1% point YoY and 9% points QoQ. The later S26 series launch helped Samsung maintain strong volumes in Q1. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola's shipment share declined by 1% point YoY. Prepaid demand remained weak but the OEM continued to push this space with earlier launches, flooding the market with new SKUs as other OEMs struggle to maintain volumes due to macroeconomic and political factors.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"5\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eGoogle's shipment share grew by 1% point YoY and remained flattish QoQ. Google has gained some ground in the premium space, along with a successful launch of the Pixel 10a.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThese smartphone market share numbers are from:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/reports/market-monitor-oem-shipment-by-region-and-countries-q1-2026\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 hover:underline\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Monitor - OEM Shipment by Region and Countries, Q1 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eExcel File | Published Date: May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThis report is part of a series of reports which track the mobile handset market: Smartphone and Feature Phone shipments every quarter for more than 140 brands covering more than 97% of the total device shipments in the industry.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/reports/market-monitor-oem-shipment-by-region-and-countries-q1-2026\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 hover:underline\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eRead more\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:info@counterpointresearch.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 hover:underline\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eContact us\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2025 Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"editor-image\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://static.counterpointresearch.com/statics/images/admin/7b9111c0-559c-11f1-9eb1-a94b32e5f363.png\" alt=\"US Smartphone Shipments Market share (Q42024 - Q4 2025)\" data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"w-full h-full\" data-full-width=\"true\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 text-center\"\u003eSource: Counterpoint Research\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eUS Smartphone Shipments Market Share (%)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable class=\"border-collapse w-full my-4 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBRANDS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ2 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e65%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e57%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e54%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e50%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e67%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung  \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e18%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e25%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e27%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e24%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e17%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e10%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e11%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e12%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e12%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e10%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eOthers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e14%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e6%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\"\u003e\u003cli value=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSmartphone shipments in the US grew 8% YoY in Q4 2025, driven by strong Apple shipments. Concerns over tariff-related impacts proved wrong as the overall US market grew YoY in 2025 as well.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple's shipment share grew to an all-time high of 67% in Q4 as the iPhone 17 series was very well received by consumers. Shipping wait times remained elevated throughout Q4 compared to the iPhone 16 series in the previous year.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung's share declined slightly by 1% due to Apple's strength in the quarter. It also faced pressure from Google in the premium segment, as well as Motorola in prepaid channels.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e Motorola's shipments maintained sales share YoY and grew in double digits YoY as it strategically launched new g 2026 series devices in the quarter. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"5\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e HMD has exited the US market, and we have ended tracking of the OEM with the Q4 data.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2025 Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"editor-image\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://static.counterpointresearch.com/statics/images/admin/fa8984d0-ebc0-11f0-a69e-bf8970a85209.jpg\" alt=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"w-full h-full\" data-full-width=\"true\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 text-center\"\u003eSource: Counterpoint Research\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\"\u003e\u003cli value=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSmartphone shipments in the US were up slightly YoY in Q3 2025 despite ongoing tariff concerns. While imports from China declined, those from other regions like Vietnam and India increased, resulting in overall shipment growth in the quarter.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple’s shipment share again declined both YoY and QoQ, but the OEM remained up in terms of YTD shipments due to the strong performance of iPhone 16e shipments earlier in the year. Shipments for the iPhone 17 series have been solid but are facing challenges from strong demand.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung grew its share modestly YoY, up one basis point but down three basis points QoQ. This was because Google saw strong increases in shipments both YoY and QoQ.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola saw some weakness in Q3 as prepaid demand was low due to macroeconomic and political factors, resulting in both YoY and QoQ share declines.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"5\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eHMD has exited the US market, and we will end tracking of the OEM by the end of the year.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eUS Smartphone Shipments Market Share (%)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable class=\"border-collapse w-full my-4 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBrands\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ2 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ2 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e52%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e53%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e65%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e57%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e54%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e50%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e24%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e23%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e18%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e25%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e27%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e24%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e12%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e14%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e10%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e11%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e12%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e12%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eHMD\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e1%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e1%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e0%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e0%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e0%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e0%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eOthers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e11%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e9%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e7%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e14%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ2 2025 Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"editor-image\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://static.counterpointresearch.com/statics/images/admin/198fdf00-ebc1-11f0-a69e-bf8970a85209.jpg\" alt=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"w-full h-full\" data-full-width=\"true\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 text-center\"\u003eSource: Counterpoint Research\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\"\u003e\u003cli value=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSmartphone shipments in the US grew 2% YoY in Q2 2025 despite tariffs being announced in April. While imports from China declined, those from other regions like Vietnam and India increased, resulting in overall shipment growth in the quarter.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple's shipment share declined both QoQ and YoY as Android shipments increased at a higher rate than iOS in the quarter. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung had double-digit YoY growth, which resulted in a higher market share, up 3 basis points to 27%, due to improved premium device shipments in the quarter.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola saw its fifth consecutive quarter of double-digit market share as it continued to pressure other prepaid-focused OEMs while also launching its RAZR 2025 series in May compared to July last year, helping shipments grow.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"5\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eHMD has announced it will exit the US market, which will leave opportunities for other OEMs to gain share.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2025 Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"editor-image\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://static.counterpointresearch.com/statics/images/admin/5ffa9ac0-ebc1-11f0-a69e-bf8970a85209.jpg\" alt=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"w-full h-full\" data-full-width=\"true\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 text-center\"\u003eSource: Counterpoint Research\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\"\u003e\u003cli value=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSmartphone shipments grew 9% YoY in Q1 2025 due to efforts, especially in March, to circumvent potential tariff-related impacts.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple achieved its highest Q1 shipment share to date at 57% due to the launch of the iPhone 16e, combined with the front-loading of shipments ahead of April.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung's share declined to 25% from 31% in Q1 2024, partially due to Apple's shipment increase, and also due to lower S25 shipments YoY.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola also had its biggest shipment share ever in Q1 at 11%, driven by an earlier launch of its G-series line-up in 2025 and improved positioning in prepaid, especially as HMD continued to show weakness in this segment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eUS Smartphone Shipments Market Share (%)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable class=\"border-collapse w-full my-4 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBrands\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2023\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ2 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e62%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px