"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://static.counterpointresearch.com/statics/images/admin/87e3e3c0-ebc1-11f0-a69e-bf8970a85209.jpg\" alt=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"w-full h-full\" data-full-width=\"true\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption data-caption=\"Source: Counterpoint Research\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 text-center\"\u003eSource: Counterpoint Research\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarket Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside\"\u003e\u003cli value=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eIn Q4 2024, US smartphone sell-in decreased 9% YoY as demand continued to be impacted by low upgrade rates and long upgrade cycles.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple’s shipments were down 5% YoY as the iPhone 16's performance was not as strong as expected. The late launch of Apple Intelligence also impacted the numbers.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSamsung’s sell-in decreased 4% YoY, as prepaid demand slowed in Q4 combined with slightly less demand for premium devices YoY.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMotorola increased 4% YoY primarily due to an improved prepaid positioning compared to other OEMs like HMD, which saw a loss in share.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli value=\"5\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eGoogle’s shipments increased 1% YoY due to larger shipments of devices as the Pixel 9 series has four SKUs compared to the Pixel 8 series' two SKUs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"mb-2 relative\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold dark:text-white\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eUS Smartphone Shipments Market Share (%)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable class=\"border-collapse w-full my-4 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\" style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003ccol\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBrands\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2023\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2023\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ1 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ2 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ3 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eQ4 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr class=\"border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\u003e\u003cth class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 font-semibold\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eApple\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e53%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 min-w-[100px]\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-a